# Test/coverage output. `coverage/` is live again as of 2026-09-11: `npm run test:coverage`
# was restored for Phase 1 of docs/testing/PHASED_TEST_PLAN.md and the v8 reporter writes
# there on every run. `playwright-report/` and `test-results/` are still produced by nothing —
# there is no playwright.config.* and no e2e/ directory yet (Phase 3 builds them). Left
# ignored rather than removed, since they are exactly what that phase will regenerate.
coverage/
playwright-report/
test-results/
# Playwright storageState — generated by e2e/global-setup.ts on every run. These hold live
# (local-only) access tokens for the seeded accounts; regenerated, never authored, never
# committed.
e2e/.auth/
# docs/qa/tracker/AUMRTI_QA_TRACKER.xlsx, the workbook these once fed, no longer exists either.
docs/qa/results/

